{"product_id":"driver","title":"Driver","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen you play with fire, everyone gets burned ...Joe Weeks is new to the Grange Estate. Tolerant, doesn't mind a bit of weed, doesn't try to pull other men's women. Live and let live is his motto ...Eddie Quinn is the hardest man on the estate. Everyone knows that it's a bad idea to cross him, or his pit bull. But everyone also knows he's honest, as drug dealers go. Joe's pleased when Eddie offers him a job. But then he meets Katya. A prostitute. A slave. And desperate to escape from Eddie.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mandasue Heller\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340954201\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45871999254681,"sku":"13RA9780340954201","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f42bb341ae_Driver.jpg?v=1762614406","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/driver","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}